('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$Same scooter. Same shared path. Legal or not? We ran a Segway MAX G3 (limited to 25 km/h) past four state rulebooks. Victoria and South Australia: yes within limits. Queensland: yes, with a licence since 31 Aug 2026. NSW: no, private e-scooters are illegal in public. Official sources and the date we checked them are on every slide. Check your state at scootfinder.au. Which state are you in?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p02-legal-s1.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p02-legal-s2.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p02-legal-s3.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p02-legal-s4.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p02-legal-s5.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p02-legal-s6.jpg'],'2026-10-12T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-12-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: SAME SCOOTER. SAME SHARED PATH. LEGAL OR NOT?$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$Same scooter. Same shared path. Legal or not?

A Segway MAX G3, limited to 25 km/h, helmet on. Victoria and South Australia say yes within limits. Queensland says yes, but since 31 Aug 2026 you need to be 16 and hold at least a learner licence. NSW says no: private e-scooters are illegal on roads, footpaths, shared paths and bike lanes.

Every slide cites the official state source, checked 11 Oct 2026. Rules change, so check yours before you ride.

Which state are you in, and did the answer surprise you?

#escooter #escooterlaws #australia #scootfinder #ridelegal
