('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$Segway MAX G3 ($1,699) vs Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Lite ($697). The G3: 56km real world estimate, 24.3kg, suspension front and rear. The 6 Lite: 18km estimate, 18.1kg, front suspension. The $1,002 gap buys 38km more estimated range and bigger tyres, and costs 6.2kg. Compare the full specs at scootfinder.au. Which would you pick?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p05-vs-s1.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p05-vs-s2.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p05-vs-s3.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p05-vs-s4.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p05-vs-s5.jpg'],'2026-10-13T22:00:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-14-am-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: $1,699 vs $697. WHICH ONE WINS?$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$$1,699 vs $697. Which one wins?

Segway MAX G3: 56km real world estimate (80km claimed), 24.3kg, front and rear hydraulic suspension, 11 inch self sealing tyres. Xiaomi Electric Scooter 6 Lite: 18km real world estimate (25km claimed), 18.1kg, front spring suspension, 10 inch pneumatic tyres.

The $1,002 gap buys 38km more estimated range, suspension at both ends and bigger tyres. It costs 6.2kg in your arm. Short flat trips and tight budget: the 6 Lite. Long commute, no stairs: the G3.

Which would you pick? Tell us below.

