('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$5 things before your first scooter. 1. Claimed range is a best case (Xiaomi 6 Lite claims 25km, we estimate 18km). 2. You carry it (Segway E3 17.8kg, F3 18.6kg, MAX G3 24.3kg). 3. Water rating is not waterproof. 4. Rules vary by state: NSW private property only, QLD 16+ with a licence since 31 Aug 2026. 5. Start here: Segway E3 at $799 (RRP $999, checked 4 Oct 2026). Compare them all at scootfinder.au. What did you wish you knew before your first scooter?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p08-first-s1.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p08-first-s2.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p08-first-s3.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p08-first-s4.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p08-first-s5.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p08-first-s6.jpg'],'2026-10-15T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-15-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: 5 THINGS BEFORE YOUR FIRST SCOOTER$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$5 things before your first scooter.

1. Claimed range is a best case. Xiaomi 6 Lite claims 25km, our estimate is 18km. Segway E3 claims 45km, estimate 31km.
2. You carry it. E3 is 17.8kg, F3 is 18.6kg, MAX G3 is 24.3kg.
3. Water rating is not waterproof. IPX5 and IPX6 mean jets, not puddles.
4. Rules vary by state. NSW is private property only, QLD wants 16+ with a licence since 31 Aug 2026.
5. Start here: Segway E3 at $799 (RRP $999, checked 4 Oct 2026).

What did you wish you knew before your first scooter?

