('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$100 km/h. Zero public roads. The Dualtron Thunder 3: 5400W peak, 2,880Wh battery, 4 piston hydraulic brakes, 47.3kg. It is private property only in every state and territory. Check price and stock at scootfinder.au. Would you buy a scooter you can only ride at home?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p09-fri-am-thunder-100kmh.jpg'],'2026-10-15T22:00:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-16-am-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: 100 km/h. 0 public roads.$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$100 km/h. Zero public roads.

The Dualtron Thunder 3 has a 5400W peak motor, a 2,880Wh battery, 4 piston hydraulic brakes and a 100 km/h top speed. It weighs 47.3kg.

The number of public roads it can legally use in Australia: zero. It is private property only in every state and territory.

Would you buy a scooter you can only ride at home? Tell us below.

