('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$$999 vs $2,899. Kaabo Mantis Urban 2026 ($999, 28km estimate, 20kg, 40km/h, can be limited to 25km/h) vs Kaabo Mantis King GT ($2,899, RRP $4,699, 64km estimate, 33.2kg, 72km/h, private land only). The King GT is more scooter. The Urban is the one built for the ride to work. Compare both at scootfinder.au. Which would you pick?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p10-price-s1.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p10-price-s2.jpg','https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p10-price-s3.jpg'],'2026-10-16T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-16-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: $999 vs $2,899. WHAT DOES $1,900 BUY?$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$$999 vs $2,899. What does $1,900 buy?

Kaabo Mantis Urban 2026: $999, 28km real world estimate, 20kg, 40km/h top speed and it can be limited to 25km/h for public riding within your state rules.

Kaabo Mantis King GT: $2,899 (RRP $4,699), 64km estimate, 33.2kg, 72km/h, dual motor and private land only.

The King GT is more scooter. The Urban is the one built for the ride to work.

Which one would you pick? Tell us below.

