('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$Charge it awake. Not asleep. Fire and Rescue NSW says you cannot smell smoke when you are asleep. Charge in a garage or shed on a hard floor, use the charger in the box, keep a working smoke alarm nearby and unplug it once it is full. If a battery smokes, get out and call 000. Where does your scooter charge at night?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p11-sat-am-charging-safety.jpg'],'2026-10-16T22:00:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-17-am-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: CHARGE IT AWAKE. NOT ASLEEP.$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$Charge it awake. Not asleep.

Fire and Rescue NSW says you cannot smell smoke when you are asleep. Charge in a garage or shed on a hard floor, use the charger that came in the box, keep a working smoke alarm nearby and unplug it once it is full.

If a battery starts smoking, get out and call 000.

Where does your scooter charge at night? Tell us below.

