('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$One scooter. Forever. Pick one. A: Range. B: Weight. C: Comfort. D: Power. You can never swap. Comment A, B, C or D, no ties. Compare all four on every scooter at scootfinder.au.$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p12-sat-pm-one-scooter-forever.jpg'],'2026-10-17T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-17-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: ONE SCOOTER. FOREVER. PICK ONE.$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$One scooter. Forever. Pick one.

A: Range. Go all day, charge less.
B: Weight. Carry it up any stairs.
C: Comfort. Suspension and big tyres.
D: Power. Hills? What hills?

You only get one, and you can never swap. Comment A, B, C or D. No ties.

