('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$No brand has more models than Segway. It lists more scooters in the ScootFinder directory than any other brand, from $399 (kids) and $599 to $4,999 for adult models. Pick the trip first, then the model. Compare them all at scootfinder.au. Which Segway do you own, or want?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p13-sun-am-segway-most-models.jpg'],'2026-10-17T22:00:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-18-am-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: No brand has more models than Segway.$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$No brand has more models than Segway.

Segway lists more scooters in the ScootFinder directory than any other brand. Prices start at $399 for a kids scooter, and adult models run from $599 to $4,999.

More choice is good. It also means picking the trip first, then the model.

