('a37d721b-3834-4086-b12d-cf25e2e146c0','image',$c$What Australia is buying right now. The Kaabo Mantis 10 Plus V2 leads the ScootFinder most popular list, ranked from Scooter Hut and Electric Kicks best seller lists (retailers do not publish sales numbers). $1,999 (RRP $2,699), 53km estimate, 30kg, 60km/h capable, can be limited to 25km/h. See the full top 10 at scootfinder.au. Is it your pick?$c$,ARRAY['https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tbhglobal/cartell-social-media/8d22722/posts/2026-10-12/scootfinder/p14-sun-pm-mantis-10-plus-v2-no1.jpg'],'2026-10-18T07:30:00+00','queued','roxy','sf-2026-10-18-pm-facebook',$a$Roxy preflight 11 Oct: full size eye audit of every slide/frame, live feed dupe check (2 reels live), facts per manifest sources, white bg corners, no dashes. Hook: WHAT AUSTRALIA IS BUYING RIGHT NOW.$a$),
('5649f5ce-3f06-4d07-83dc-1e02e66ad18c','image',$c$What Australia is buying right now.

The Kaabo Mantis 10 Plus V2 is number one on our most popular list, built from the best seller lists at Scooter Hut and Electric Kicks. $1,999 (RRP $2,699), 53km real world estimate, 30kg, 60km/h capable, and it can be limited to 25km/h for public riding within your state rules.

Retailers do not publish sales numbers, so this is best seller lists, not sales totals.

Is the Mantis 10 Plus V2 your pick, or would you go a different way? Tell us below.

